    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>285912</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_000Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この街はずっと
こんな調子さ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This town has been like
this for a very long time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286036</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_001Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>こんなに貧しいのに、
ここの人々は何の見返りもなく
僕を受け容れてくれた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>They're so poor, but
they took me in without
a second thought.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286124</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_002Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>僕はエルフだ。
だが、魔術が使えない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm an elf.
But, I can't
use magic.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286224</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それって、
『レスネス』ってヤツ？
前に本で読んだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's what they call
"Lesneth," right? I read
about it in a book.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286304</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>レス、ネス……？
何それ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Les...neth...?
What's that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286412</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔術使えないエルフ。
百年にひとりしか
生まれねんだって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Elves who can't use magic.
They say they're only born
once every 100 years.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286584</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_006Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よく知っているね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You know
quite a lot.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286584</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_007Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>『レスネス』はエルフの里を
不幸にするとされていて、
生まれるとすぐ里を追い出される</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Lesneth" are thought to bring bad
luck to the village, so they're chased
out as soon as they're born.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286664</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>じゃあ、
バジルさんも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Then, Basil,
you too...?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286828</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_009Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そう。居場所をなくした僕は
この街に流れついた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right. With nowhere
else to live, I ended
up in this village.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286828</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_010Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よそ者の僕にも
ここの人たちはよくしてくれた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I was an outsider,
but these people
treated me well.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>286924</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だから、
アルヴァニスタじゃなくて
ここに？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So that's why you're
here, and not in Alvanista?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287108</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_012Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ。ここの方が
居心地がいいからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. I always
feel more at ease
when I'm here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287108</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_013Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それに、一番大切なことを
教えられる気がするんだ。
自分が今、何をするべきか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And I feel like this is the place where I
can learn the most important thing of
all. What I should be doing, right now.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287180</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_014&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それが
魔術の研究？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What about your
magic research?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287396</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_015Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>人も『レスネス』も関係なく、
魔術を使えるようになるための
技術の研究さ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, I'm researching a technology that
will enable everyone to use magic—
human or not, "Lesneth" or not.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287396</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_016Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔術がもっとなじめば、
きっとこの村を、いや世界を
もっと豊かにできるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If magic becomes more commonplace,
then surely this village—no, this
entire world—will benefit, and prosper.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287472</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でっかい夢だな、それ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Wow... That's kinda
an amazing dream...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287612</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_018Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どんな大きな夢でも
思い続けなければ叶わない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However big your dreams, if
you don't continue to believe in
them, they'll never come true.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287612</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_019Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>信じることが
大切なんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You need faith.
It's important.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_020&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>信じること、か。う～ん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Faith, huh? Hmm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287840</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_022Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>君には
そういう夢はないのかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't you have any
dreams like that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287924</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレ……？
オレはええっと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Me...?
I, uhh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>287992</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>何かになりたい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wanna do things!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288076</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>何かって……
きみは、もう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"Do things"...
You really...just...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288220</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_026&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>じゃなくって！　どうすりゃいいかは
わかんねーけど、自分の足で
歩いてけるようになりたいんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nah, nah! I don't know *what*
I should do, but still, I wanna
stand on my own two feet!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288284</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_027&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それで……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And so, y'know...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288452</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_028Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ハハッ、
ゆっくり考えればいいさ。
君の未来は真っ白だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Haha. Well, think it over
carefully. You've got a
bright future. Pure white.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>We changed it some but TL check pls</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288452</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_029Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>君はまだ
どんなものにでも
なれるんだからさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you start now, you
can become anything
you want to be.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>28</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288536</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_030&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>真っ白……
どんなもんにでも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Pure white...
Anything I want...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_031Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>強く願い続ければ、
どんな気持ちでも叶う、
そう思うんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you continue to hold that wish, hold
onto it with all you've got, your desires
will be granted. That's what I believe.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>TL</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288692</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_032Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だから、
がんばれよ、&lt;Dio&gt;！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, give it all
you've got, &lt;Dio&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288764</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_033&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、う、うん……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, uh, yeah...! I will!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288992</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_034Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>僕も人を応援している場合じゃ
ないんだけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, I'm not really in any
position to be rooting for
others, though, myself.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288992</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_035Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>でも、&lt;Klarth&gt;もまた
やる気になってくれたし、
研究も進展すると思う。</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, now that &lt;Klarth&gt; has his
motivation back, there should be
some progress in my research, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>288992</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_036Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔科学があれば
もう少し……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And If I have
magitech, then...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289052</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_037&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔科学？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Magitech?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289120</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_038Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ん？　いや……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hm? Oh, it's
nothing...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289200</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_039&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Rody&gt;、何をやってるんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Rody&gt;, what are you doing?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289292</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_040&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ん？　空がきれいだなって
見とれてたんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hm? I just thought the
sky was really pretty, so
I couldn't stop looking at it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289400</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_041&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>さてと……どこか
泊まれるところを
借りられないだろうか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That aside... I wonder if
there's anywhere we
can rest for the night.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289492</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_042Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>そうか、よかったら、
うちを使ってくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah. If it's okay with
you, how about you
stay at mine?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289616</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_043Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふたりともおはよう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Good morning,
you two.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289616</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_044Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>アルヴァニスタから
返信があったよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I got word back
from Alvanista.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289708</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_045&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それで、
ウンディーネんとこへ
行けんだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So with this, we
can go to where
Undine is, yeah?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289804</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_046Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ、北の海の&lt;Red&gt;浸食洞&lt;White&gt;の
立ち入り許可証だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. It's a permit of
entry to the northern
sea's &lt;Red&gt;Limestone Cave&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>46</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289884</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_047&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>サンキュー、
バジルさん！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thanks, Basil!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>289956</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_048&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ありがとうございます</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you very much.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>48</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290104</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_049Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>いや。頑張りなよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Don't mention it. Just
do your best out there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290104</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_050Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>将来、君たちに目指すものが
見つかるよう応援しているからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Because I'm hoping that, soon
enough, you kids will find the
goals you want to strive for, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290164</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_051&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>51</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290248</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_052Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Klarth&gt;、
約束、忘れないでくれよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Klarth&gt;. Don't
forget our promise.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290308</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_053&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ん、ああ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Yeah.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>will need to see line delivery</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>53</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290420</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_054&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>うぉし、
&lt;Dio&gt;くん、&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃん、
精霊さんに会いに行こうぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Awwrighty. &lt;Dio&gt;, &lt;Mel&gt;,
let's go get that spirit!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>54</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290480</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_055&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おうっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeahh!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>55</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>290544</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_050_056&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>は、はい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>O-Okay...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
